</span><span begin="00:09.840" end="00:10.200">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.200" end="00:13.560"><span begin="00:10.200" end="00:10.440">I </span><span begin="00:10.440" end="00:10.980">want </span><span begin="00:10.980" end="00:11.190">it </span><span begin="00:11.190" end="00:12.030">to </span><span begin="00:12.030" end="00:13.350">burn</span><span begin="00:13.350" end="00:13.560">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.560" end="00:17.190"><span begin="00:13.560" end="00:13.980">When </span><span begin="00:13.980" end="00:14.130">you </span><span begin="00:14.130" end="00:14.490">tell </span><span begin="00:14.490" end="00:14.970">me </span><span begin="00:14.970" end="00:15.060">I'm </span><span begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.960">such </span><span begin="00:15.960" end="00:16.110">a </span><span begin="00:16.110" end="00:16.740">wreck</span><span begin="00:16.740" end="00:17.190">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.190" end="00:20.880"><span begin="00:17.190" end="00:17.550">it </span><span begin="00:17.550" end="00:17.970">isn't </span><span begin="00:17.970" end="00:18.330">easy </span><span begin="00:18.330" end="00:18.930">cleaning </span><span begin="00:18.930" end="00:19.500">up </span><span begin="00:19.500" end="00:19.710">your </span><span begin="00:19.710" end="00:20.670">mess</span><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:20.880">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.880" end="00:24.900"><span begin="00:20.880" end="00:21.180">It's </span><span begin="00:21.180" end="00:21.420">like </span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.570">I've </span><span begin="00:21.570" end="00:21.960">got </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:22.080">a </span><span begin="00:22.080" end="00:22.380">rope </span><span begin="00:22.380" end="00:23.160">around </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.430">my </span><span begin="00:23.430" end="00:24.360">neck</span><span begin="00:24.360" end="00:24.900">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.900" end="00:29.580"><span begin="00:24.900" end="00:25.170">she </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:25.770">says </span><span begin="00:25.770" end="00:25.890">it </span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:27.000">won't </span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:28.380">hurt</span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:29.580">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.580" end="00:32.760"><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.970">But </span><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.630">everything </span><span begin="00:30.630" end="00:30.780">you </span><span begin="00:30.780" end="00:31.290">do </span><span begin="00:31.290" end="00:31.560">makes </span><span begin="00:31.560" end="00:31.680">my </span><span begin="00:31.680" end="00:32.160">heart </span><span begin="00:32.160" end="00:32.760">race</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.760" end="00:34.620"><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:32.880">I </span><span begin="00:32.880" end="00:33.240">can't </span><span begin="00:33.240" end="00:33.570">even </span><span begin="00:33.570" end="00:33.990">think </span><span begin="00:33.990" end="00:34.620">straight</span><span begin="00:34.620" end="00:34.620">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.620" end="00:37.200"><span begin="00:34.620" end="00:34.830">is </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:35.040">this </span><span begin="00:35.040" end="00:35.340">just </span><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.430">a </span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:36.150">game </span><span begin="00:36.150" end="00:36.360">to </span><span begin="00:36.360" end="00:37.170">you</span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.200">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.200" end="00:39.180"><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:38.280">Reruns </span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.670">every </span><span begin="00:38.670" end="00:39.150">night</span><span begin="00:39.150" end="00:39.180">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.180" end="00:43.530"><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.450">it's </span><span begin