/span><span begin="00:51.990" end="00:52.320">all </span><span begin="00:52.320" end="00:52.620">that </span><span begin="00:52.620" end="00:52.800">I've </span><span begin="00:52.800" end="00:52.950">been </span><span begin="00:52.950" end="00:54.030">dreaming </span><span begin="00:54.030" end="00:54.540">of</span><span begin="00:54.540" end="00:54.780">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.780" end="00:58.290"><span begin="00:54.780" end="00:55.140">This </span><span begin="00:55.140" end="00:55.590">is </span><span begin="00:55.590" end="00:56.100">not </span><span begin="00:56.100" end="00:56.580">another </span><span begin="00:56.580" end="00:57.030">song </span><span begin="00:57.030" end="00:57.480">about </span><span begin="00:57.480" end="00:58.230">love</span><span begin="00:58.230" end="00:58.290">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.290" end="01:00.150"><span begin="00:58.290" end="00:58.470">I </span><span begin="00:58.470" end="00:58.950">hate </span><span begin="00:58.950" end="00:59.430">your </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="01:00.090">voice</span><span begin="01:00.090" end="01:00.150">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.150" end="01:02.040"><span begin="01:00.150" end="01:00.270">I </span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:00.810">hate </span><span begin="01:00.810" end="01:01.230">your </span><span begin="01:01.230" end="01:01.920">lips</span><span begin="01:01.920" end="01:02.040">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.040" end="01:05.790"><span begin="01:02.040" end="01:02.160">I </span><span begin="01:02.160" end="01:02.670">hate </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.120">how </span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:03.450">bad </span><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:03.600">I </span><span begin="01:03.600" end="01:03.960">wanna </span><span begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.500">steal </span><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.950">your </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.760">kiss</span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01: